	(text "GATE DRIVE / CURRENT (firmware, see docs/driver-design-notes.md)\nAOD4126 Qgd 10 nC typ -> DRVSTRENGTH 0..1, RG max 10 ohm (TMC5160 DS)\nRG = 10 ohm (R20, R29-R31, R35, R36, R40, R41), no parallel diode\nDRV_CONF: DRVSTRENGTH = 1, BBMTIME = 8 (~133 ns), BBMCLKS = 0\nTarget slope < 100 ns; if 40-80 ns measured -> BBMTIME = 0\nCurrent: RSENSE 22 mOhm, VFS 325 mV -> 10.45 A RMS full scale\nGLOBALSCALER = 131, IRUN = 29 -> 5.0 A RMS (7.1 A peak)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
